  "plan": {
    "goal": "Co-incubate UGT2B7 with UDPGA at 4807.1 µM in the presence of a competitive inhibitor (Ki = 251.7 µM) at 376.6 µM, Vmax = 0.2698 µmol/min, and characterize the run-condition IC50, inhibited velocity, apparent Km and percent inhibition.",
    "rationale": "UGT2B7 glucuronidation of UDPGA substrate is modeled with Michaelis-Menten kinetics under competitive inhibition. Km = 1850.9 µM, substrate [S] = 4807.1 µM, inhibitor [I] = 376.6 µM, Ki = 251.7 µM, Vmax = 0.2698 µmol/min. The run-condition IC50 follows Cheng-Prusoff (IC50 = Ki(1+[S]/Km)); apparent Km = Km(1+[I]/Ki); fractional activity = [S]/(Km(1+[I]/Ki)+[S]); inhibited velocity = fractional activity × Vmax; percent inhibition = (1 - fractional activity) × 100. The inhibitor:substrate ratio is ~0.078, a modest competitive load.",
